<body>
    <div class="info">
        <section>
            <h2 class="container">Return / Exchange Policy</h2>
    
            <p>Customers can exchange their order within 7 days from the date of delivery.</p>
    
    
            <h5>Exchange Conditions</h5>
    
            <p>VINTITI reserves the right to decline exchanges if the products.</p>
            <p>1. Appears to have been used, washed, or soiled.</p>
            <p>2. Are damaged (except in cases where the damage occurred during delivery).</p>
    
            <p> We do not offer reverse pickup of products unless confirmed by our customer experience team. If you receive a defective product, please send images to  <a href="mailto:support@vintiti.com">support@vintiti.com</a>. Our customer experience team will review your case and get back to you.</p>
    
            <p>Once the issue is confirmed, we will arrange the reverse pickup within 7 days of receiving your request.</p>
            
            <p>Please ensure the product is returned in its original packaging, as delivered.</p>
    
    
            <h5>Process</h5>
    
            <p>To initiate an exchange, visit the "Exchange Portal" on our website, fill out the exchange form, and submit it. Our customer experience team will contact you within 48 hours. You can also reach us at  <a href="+91 7020426569">+91 7020426569</a> or  <a href="mailto:support@vintiti.com">support@vintiti.com</a>.</p>
    
    
            <h5>Order Confirmation / Cancellation</h5>
            
            <p>If you placed a COD order, our customer service team will call you to confirm before shipping.</p>
    
            <p>Once an order is canceled, it cannot be reinstated. A new order will need to be placed.</p>
    
            <p>Orders in processing status cannot be canceled. For any changes to your order before it has been shipped, please call us directly, and we will do our best to accommodate your request. Changes cannot be made once the order has shipped.</p>
    
    
            <h5>Refunds</h5>
            
            <p>We do not accept returns for purchases made from VINTITI.</p>
    
            <p>Complaints regarding defective products will only be addressed if reported within 24 hours of delivery.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
    <script src="/js/policy.js"></script>    
</body>
</html>